<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1958358483"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1628810442"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="White Spell"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="麻枝准 / やなぎなぎ"/><amll:meta key="album" value="White Spell"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:39.999"><div begin="00:03.269" end="04:39.999"><p begin="00:03.269" end="00:15.072" itunes:key="L1">（眩しさでもう見えない）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(光芒炫目)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( ma bu shi sa de )</span></p><p begin="00:23.283" end="00:29.220" itunes:key="L2">風が強くて胸が騒ぐ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">强风吹拂 内心蠢蠢欲动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ze ga tsu yo ku te mu ne ga sa wa gu</span></p><p begin="00:29.221" end="00:34.809" itunes:key="L3">鳥は季節を越えて飛んだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">鸟儿振翅飞越了季节</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ri ha ki se tsu wo ko e te to n da</span></p><p begin="00:34.810" end="00:40.783" itunes:key="L4">星を目指しどこまでもゆく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以星星为目标决然前行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho shi wo me za shi do ko ma de mo yu ku</span></p><p begin="00:40.784" end="00:45.334" itunes:key="L5">ぼくら旅人<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们是旅人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra ta bi bi to</span></p><p begin="00:46.576" end="00:52.515" itunes:key="L6">鮮やかな景色が揺らぎ移ろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">艳丽的景色摇晃着转变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a za ya ka na ke shi ki ga yu ra gi u tsu ro u</span></p><p begin="00:52.516" end="00:57.737" itunes:key="L7">海の青さえ別れを告げ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">甚至要告别大海的蔚蓝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u mi no a o sa e wa ka re wo tsu ge</span></p><p begin="00:57.833" end="01:03.463" itunes:key="L8">その日が来たならぼくは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那日到来时的我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no hi ga ki ta na ra bo ku ha</span></p><p begin="01:03.464" end="01:09.502" itunes:key="L9">笑うか泣くかなどっちだ（そんな朝は）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">会是笑着还是哭泣呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ra u ka na ku ka na do 'c chi da</span></p><p begin="01:09.503" end="01:14.928" itunes:key="L10">きみの跡を追いかけた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">追逐着你的踪迹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no a to wo o i ka ke ta</span></p><p begin="01:14.929" end="01:18.808" itunes:key="L11">一緒に行けたらよかった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若能与你同行就好了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i 's sho ni i ke ta ra yo ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:18.809" end="01:24.543" itunes:key="L12">もう見えない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然而已经看不见了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u mi e na i</span></p><p begin="01:33.087" end="01:38.954" itunes:key="L13">そろそろ風が冷たくなる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">很快风就要变冷</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ro so ro ka ze ga tsu me ta ku na ru</span></p><p begin="01:38.955" end="01:44.841" itunes:key="L14">実りの季節なんてすぐ去る<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">收获的季节转眼即将逝去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi no ri no ki se tsu na n te su gu sa ru</span></p><p begin="01:44.842" end="01:54.930" itunes:key="L15">咲き乱れる頃にもう一度巡り会うため<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了当繁花盛放之时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa ki mi da re ru ko ro ni mo u i chi do</span></p><p begin="01:56.406" end="02:02.225" itunes:key="L16">息が白くなって指がかじかむ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呼吸泛起白雾 指尖冻得僵硬</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki ga shi ro ku na 't te yu bi ga ka ji ka mu</span></p><p begin="02:02.226" end="02:07.445" itunes:key="L17">それでも前へ もっと先へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便如此也要向前 继续向前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re de mo ma e he mo 't to sa ki he</span></p><p begin="02:07.664" end="02:13.126" itunes:key="L18">ほんとのこと伝えたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若我将真心告诉你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho n to u no ko to tsu ta e ta ra</span></p><p begin="02:13.127" end="02:19.336" itunes:key="L19">怒るか泣くかなどっちだ（名を呼んでも）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你会生气还是哭泣呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o ko ru ka na ku ka na do 'c chi da</span></p><p begin="02:19.337" end="02:24.797" itunes:key="L20">その隣に居たかった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想陪在你身边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no to na ri ni i ta ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="02:24.798" end="02:27.330" itunes:key="L21">ひとりにしないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要独留我一个人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to ri ni shi na i de</span></p><p begin="02:27.331" end="02:33.203" itunes:key="L22">孤独に返さないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要以孤独回应我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko do ku ni ka e sa na i de</span></p><p begin="02:33.595" end="02:43.303" itunes:key="L23">きみの寝言は呪文だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你熟睡时的呓语就像咒语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no ne go to ha ju mo n da</span></p><p begin="03:01.718" end="03:06.891" itunes:key="L24">いつか辿り着く時は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将来抵达之时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka ta do ri tsu ku to ki ha</span></p><p begin="03:06.892" end="03:13.165" itunes:key="L25">笑うか泣くかなどっちだ（そんな朝は）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会笑着还是哭泣呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ra u ka na ku ka na do 'c chi da</span></p><p begin="03:13.166" end="03:18.549" itunes:key="L26">きみの跡を追いかけた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">追逐着你的踪迹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no a to wo o i ka ke ta</span></p><p begin="03:18.550" end="03:23.715" itunes:key="L27">一緒に行けたらよかった（名を呼んでも）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若能与你同行就好了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i 's sho ni i ke ta ra yo ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="03:24.696" end="03:30.226" itunes:key="L28">もうそろそろ冬支度をしよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">差不多该做好迎接冬天的准备了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u so ro so ro fu yu ji ta ku wo shi yo u</span></p><p begin="03:30.227" end="03:36.390" itunes:key="L29">実りの季節なんてすぐ去る（そんな朝は）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">收获的季节转眼即将逝去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi no ri no ki se tsu na n te su gu sa ru</span></p><p begin="03:36.391" end="03:41.849" itunes:key="L30">風に消され眩しさに閉ざされ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被风吹散</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ze ni ke sa re</span></p><p begin="03:41.850" end="03:45.875" itunes:key="L31">さよならはそんな朝がいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告别就该在那样的清晨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa yo na ra ha so n na a sa ga i i</span></p><p begin="03:46.226" end="04:39.999" itunes:key="L32">（名を呼んでももう見えない）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(即使呼唤你的姓名)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( na wo yo n de mo )</span></p></div></body></tt>